<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Dec trade surplus 9.6 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Dec trade surplus 9.6 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's December trade surplus was 9.6 billion crowns ($1.3 billion), Statistics Sweden said on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p> Exports			 44.7	 51.5	 44.7</p>
<p> Imports			 35.1	 39.3	 37.4</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +9.6	+12.2	 +7.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 9.5 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003 ($ = 7.227 Swedish Crowns)</p>
